    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_pRag61IWkc17-GYP-IqzRNyy5.jpg"><p><span>💡本期导言</span><br><span>本期是加更，全是吐槽！没有任何营养！！大夏天，看剧吃瓜，最解暑……尤其是带娃闹完一整天，终于睡着之后……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">1:39</a> 聊聊各自，曾看过恋综的历史</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">4:34</a> 先聊聊《心动的信号8》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> 去年看完心动，打开最大的一扇窗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a> 终于开始聊“半熟恋人第五季”，恋爱天花板66周老板</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> lbk塔塔</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">17:33</a> 萱萱文韬</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a> 李政惠惠</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a> 剩下“独美”的几个人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 聊聊第一次约会的地点，如何准备</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2039">33:59</a> 特别想知道，有没有已育couple，也喜欢半夜看恋综</span></p><p><span>💖爱的祝福 </span><br><span>Work Hard, Play Hard</span></p><p><span>🐈️关于我们</span><br><span>Simon：沐光小羊</span><br><span>Clara：ESFJ，Foodie，前四大咨询狗，妈妈</span><br><span>吵吵闹闹的生活，蒙受祝福的感动，养育4只猫，1只儿+2只孕育中</span></p>]]></description>
