    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvsx0QD3D4aB9fymJxyaGPLWZFSd.png"><p><br><span>💡本期导言</span><br><span>分享2026上半年，我们的经历、甚至遭遇，当阴霾散去后，坚定迈出“寻找”的那一步</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">1:12</a> 当谎言、诋毁、中伤，编织的虚伪“泡泡”被戳灭之后</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="476">7:56</a> Simon反思：追求真实，是很重要的事！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="781">13:01</a> Clara反思：装备自己、不心急、共同见证</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 剧烈的阵痛，带来成长</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1037">17:17</a> Simon的分享：重回健身房</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1359">22:39</a> Clara的分享：心趴上的普拉提老师</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a> Simon的分享：给儿子做术后护理</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2081">34:41</a> Clara的分享：结识朋友的新感受</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2247">37:27</a> Simon的分享：年初父亲突发脑梗与变化</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2717">45:17</a> Clara的分享：libby、绘本、有声书</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2948">49:08</a> 儿子的动作模仿、扣东西、秩序感</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3026">50:26</a> 寻则寻见，踏出“寻”的那一步</span><br></p><p><span>💖爱的祝福 </span><br><span>For everyone who asks, receives. Everyone who seeks, finds. And to everyone who knocks, the door will be opened.</span></p><p><span>🐈️关于我们</span><br><span>Simon：沐光小羊</span><br><span>Clara：ESFJ，Foodie，前四大咨询狗，妈妈</span><br><span>吵吵闹闹的生活，蒙受祝福的感动，养育4只猫，1只儿</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
