  <item>
    <title>Ep.36 当奶爸一个月手机时间骤降：是父爱来临，还是爸爸的求助信号？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e23c858e321a0d6ffc206e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e23c858e321a0d6ffc206e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Oct 2025 10:08:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."><strong><br><span> </span><br><span>💡本期导言</span></strong><br><span>月卡体验的最后一期啦，这期有很多带娃一个月彼此之间真实的唠嗑分享，宝宝既是家里新到的小成员，也是夫妻关系的炼金石，在这样磕磕碰碰彼此体谅支持中度过的一个月，也是人生很难得的体验了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">01:47</a> 新手妈妈的崩溃时刻：做了很多又好像什么都没做</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">04:54</a> 新手爸爸的崩溃时刻：凌晨3点在搜“如何把衣服上的屎洗干净”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="851">14:11</a> 独立带娃的我们到底如何做好月子：三点干货分享</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">15:34</a> Clara：如果豚豚的爸爸不是Simon，应该无法实现独立带娃这件事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> Simon灵魂拷问：对儿子现在的颜值打几分？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> Simon月嫂反解“月嫂摸鱼哲学“,“如果不是亲生的，这个娃打死我都不带!”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1471">24:31</a> Clara对Simon的夸夸时刻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a> Simon的真实暴论时刻：没有体会到任何父爱，(还)没有跟儿子产生bonding</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1712">28:32</a> 突如其来的告白时刻～～～♥️</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2001">33:21</a> Children are a gift from the LORD, they are a reward from him.</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2084">34:44</a> Simon的强烈护犊时刻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2238">37:18</a> 独立带娃是特别符合我们家庭的一个选择，弊端是爸爸的潜在产后抑郁</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2569">42:49</a> 现在的付出可以帮助爸妈后期的放手</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a> 意外的收获：手机使用时间骤降！！宝宝的每个cycle就像个番茄时钟</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2847">47:27</a> Clara的啪啪打脸时刻：对孩子的哭声完全忍不了一点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3166">52:46</a> 满月儿保告知仍是小短腿，Simon对Clara的夸夸时刻，给时间多些时间</span></p><span></span><p><span>💖爱的祝福</span><br><span>每个人都要快快地听，慢慢地说，慢慢地动怒</span><br><span>Everyone should be quick to listen, slow to speak and slow to become angry</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐈️关于我们</span><br><span>Simon：沐光小羊</span><br><span>Clara：ESFJ，Foodie，前四大咨询狗，妈妈</span><br><span>吵吵闹闹的生活，蒙受祝福的感动，养育4只猫，1只儿</span></p>]]></description>
