    <title>Ep.33 从产房到婴儿台：0经验父母的极限48小时</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686369cf93fd2d72b8e90472</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686369cf93fd2d72b8e90472</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Jul 2025 05:06:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."><strong><span>💡本期导言</span></strong><br><span>这一期，回顾了从宫缩发动，到入院生产，以及产后护理的种种情况。愿能帮助到孕中后期，茫然无措的新手爸妈，彼此多倚靠，多祝福，一切顺利~~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">2:05</a> 生产前的最后一次产检</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">3:56</a> 突然有宫缩了！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">6:01</a> 收拾家务，准备出发</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">9:03</a> 特别peace，不着急的急诊</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> 终于入住了LDR家化病房</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a> 第二产程了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 像一条鲶鱼，滑出来了！🐟</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> 特别的儿科交接仪式</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> ❗️护理警报！晕倒，摔倒！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1734">28:54</a> 感觉特不真实，像做梦穿越了一样</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1801">30:01</a> 小宝宝回到了病房，然后……</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 哭到凌晨一两点，我突然崩溃了，然后走出病房发现……</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2191">36:31</a> 冲奶粉的奶爸，第一次没找到“勺子”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 一家三口出院🚗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2526">42:06</a> Clara生产总结：待产包、腹式呼吸、老公的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span>💖爱的祝福</span><br><span>Then make me truly happy by agreeing wholeheartedly with each other, loving one another, and working together with one mind and purpose.</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐈️关于我们</span><br><span>Simon：沐光小羊</span><br><span>Clara：ESFJ，Foodie，前四大咨询狗，刚出月子的妈妈</span><br><span>吵吵闹闹的生活，蒙受祝福的感动，养育4只猫，1只儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>附：儿子神态相似图</span><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
