    <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."><strong><span>💡本期导言</span></strong><br><span>失踪节目，回归啦，这是一期录制得很早，但拖很久没剪辑的节目。回听当时孕39周的我们，还在谈笑风声，嗯，再然后……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">2:34</a> 提前两个月，准备好的待产包🎒</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">3:23</a> 孕晚期的运动🏃‍♀️分享</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">4:22</a> 在四叶草的展会，喝完一整年的奶茶🧋</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="395">6:35</a> 工作人员“异常”忙碌的放空场所</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="481">8:01</a> 胎心监护tips：边吃小甜点🍰</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">9:44</a> 孕晚期准妈妈的心态💗分享</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">10:33</a> 准爸爸的各种🐮🐴准备</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="836">13:56</a> 终极问题：你准备好当妈妈了吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">16:57</a> 关于母乳的想法🍼</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1188">19:48</a> 我不想在医院过生日🎂！</span></p><span></span><p><span>💖爱的祝福</span><br><span>You have taught children and infants to tell of your strength, silencing your enemies and all who oppose you.</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐈️关于我们</span><br><span>Simon：沐光小羊</span><br><span>Clara：ESFJ，Foodie，前四大咨询狗</span><br><span>吵吵闹闹的生活，蒙受祝福的感动，养育4只猫，录制时还在孕育中的宝宝</span></p>]]></description>
