  <item>
    <title>Ep.31 孩子哭了你名字还没定！孕晚期夫妻“取名焦虑症”急救指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e602a28eecdbeb6098f089</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e602a28eecdbeb6098f089</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Mar 2025 02:07:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."><strong><span>💡本期导言</span></strong><br><span>这期内容，分享了我们接近一个多月，为小孩取名字的历程。愿此时此刻，也在为文思枯竭，抓耳挠腮的准爸爸妈妈们，提供一些小提示与建议，祝你们“取名”顺利愉快~~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">0:59</a> 小孩取名字是否重要？我们产生了重大分歧🐣</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">1:52</a> 最初计划，取名字时间：预产期前1个月，结果……</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">3:25</a> 小孩跟谁姓？姓爸、姓妈、姓黄河</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">4:31</a> 取名的任务，究竟包办给谁？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="359">5:59</a> 名字里面几个字？单、双、元素周期表🪨</span><br><span>---------------------------------------</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="451">7:31</a> Tips1，选择亘古、自然❄️的字，避开随着时代变化的字</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">9:03</a> Tips2，名字的查重考虑🔗（附链接）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">11:26</a> Tips3，姓名音调🎵与平仄组合，推荐平仄平，平平仄，仄平平</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="801">13:21</a> Tips4，避免孤僻难用的字：查询在输入法第几页</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a> Tips5❗️【重要】想象一下，小孩未来，怎样一句话介绍自己？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a> Tips5+，复杂介绍，引申含义寓意的可能性</span><br><span>---------------------------------------</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="969">16:09</a> Tips6，要不要多考虑被人取绰号？答案，NO</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">17:09</a> Tips7，小孩的英文名？长大了自己取！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a> Tips8❗️【重要】一定不要拖到临产后，再取名字！！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> 取小名经历，卡皮巴拉给到的灵感！！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1249">20:49</a> 祝福准爸妈，都能enjoy为“小天使”取名的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span>附：查询同名人数（全国，地区，男，女）zwfw.mps.gov.cn</span><br><span>小名灵感💡，源自“卡皮巴拉”</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>💖爱的祝福</span><br><span>Though they stumble, they will never fall, for the Lord holds them by the hand.</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐈️关于我们</span><br><span>Simon：沐光小羊，预备中的准爸爸</span><br><span>Clara：准妈妈，ESFJ，Foodie，前四大咨询狗</span><br><span>吵吵闹闹的生活，蒙受祝福的感动，养育4只猫，孕育中的宝宝</span></p>]]></description>
