    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jan 2025 06:56:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💡本期导言</span></strong><br><span>月子中心 vs 独立带娃，新手妈妈的钱包和心态，到底哪个先崩？这一期，我们有了自己的答案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">3:04</a> 月子中心，之探访始末</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">5:42</a> 大模型Deep Clara，月子中心的多维表格（附最后）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">6:55</a> 最不能接受的点：月嫂是常驻，而不是on call</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="496">8:16</a> 全部外包托付，过度消费主义的陷阱</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">9:52</a> 灵魂拷问：如果这样，那为啥还要生小孩呢？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 月子中心的妈妈餐，其实，没想象中的那么好</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="762">12:42</a> 有帮助的点，洗头吹干，妈妈自己的me time</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="883">14:43</a> 30天呆在一室一厅？很有必要，提前思考想象</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a> 勇敢参加，最后一次年会抽奖</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> Simon的lastday分享</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a> 蹭饭天花板，google公司的见闻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1697">28:17</a> 孕期普拉提的update</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1784">29:44</a> 幸福是不可被追求的，只能是某一个具体目标的副产品</span></p><span></span><p><span>附录</span><br><span>🎤知行小酒馆 E173 家务、生育与婚恋选择，如何给现代家庭生活定价？</span><br><span>💻Deep Clara的月子中心分析图</span><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..png!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><span>💖爱的祝福</span><br><span>He will be filled with the Holy Spirit, even before his birth.</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐈️关于我们</span><br><span>Simon：沐光小羊，预备中的准爸爸</span><br><span>Clara：准妈妈，ESFJ，Foodie，前四大咨询狗</span><br><span>吵吵闹闹的生活，蒙受祝福的感动，养育4只猫，孕育中的宝宝</span></p>]]></description>
